## The Council

These figures represent the greatest marketers, salespeople, philosophers, persuaders, and logical minds across history. **Each category has one influence per era:** Today, Early 2000s, 1800s, 1600s, BC. In creative mode, apply their **sum of rationale** — the distilled principles that transcend any single discipline.

